{"title":"1999 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be points on the plane and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be a point on the bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. A sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa4feffc3242e637f50bd1cea9c84bf7e811ae5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1, C_2, \\cdots , C_n, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> is constructed in the following way:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d231918c6f75c605690c1d1305557df43f14ed35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1 = C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897470a282b6b85fa5221eacd41369b9a157f491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e173907ca992482385a50c6f62ede920362b1bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> does not belong to segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, C_{n+1} is the circumcenter of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fec10f41b0a9f05b03024107472a81028c77bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Find all points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> such that the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa4feffc3242e637f50bd1cea9c84bf7e811ae5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1, C_2, \\cdots , C_n, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> is defined for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and is periodic from a certain point.\n</p><p>NOTE: A sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa4feffc3242e637f50bd1cea9c84bf7e811ae5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1, C_2, \\cdots , C_n, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> is periodic from a certain point if there are positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5637060fe4688819d59623d55e1eca05f3bea459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_{n+p} = C_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd614aab3401d541b41d996669ed8ab088c7fc77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1999_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe14.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe14.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016212807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3206/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.367      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.367      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26126:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016212807 and revision id 207116. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}